                    <run lmargin='555' rmargin='555'>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#252423' fontname='Segoe UI' lmargin='555' rmargin='555'>Module : Use this dropdown slicer to slice the data for respective report.</run>
                    <run lmargin='555' rmargin='555'>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#252423' fontname='Segoe UI' lmargin='555' rmargin='555'>Data Vendor : Use this slicer to select the Data vendor like IQVIA, VEEVA CRM etc.</run>
